  "definition": "Suspension and Termination of Services",
  "effectiveDate": "2013-07-23",
  "historyNote": "#6644, eff 12-2-97; ss and moved by #8155, eff 9-2-04 (from He-M 401.16), EXPIRED: 9-2-12 New. #10256, INTERIM, eff 1-24-13, EXPIRES: 7-23-13; ss by #10383, eff 7-23-13",
